# WH40K Cyborg QoL, Built-in PDA, ID Card, Power & Poses

ent-Wh40kBorgIdCard = cyborg ID card
    .desc = An identification card issued to a cyborg. It can hold the deed to a ship and unlock crew doors even while stowed.

ent-Wh40kActionBorgOpenPda = Open Built-in PDA
    .desc = Access the cogitator PDA integrated into your chassis.

ent-Wh40kActionBorgPoseRest = Rest
    .desc = Power down into a resting posture. Use again or move to stand up.

ent-Wh40kActionBorgPoseSit = Sit
    .desc = Sit down where you are. Use again or move to stand up.

ent-Wh40kActionBorgPoseBellyUp = Roll Over
    .desc = Roll onto your back. Use again or move to stand up.

wh40k-borg-examine-cell = Its power cell slot holds [color=yellow]{$cell}[/color].
